  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;&apos;Smart for you-two: development of the potential of tourism by promoting cultural heritage and values</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 Improved conditions for presentation and protection of valuable museum objects;1.2 Upgraded potentials of public infrastructure for cultural and touristic purposes;1.3 Enabled access to museum settings and equal treatment of people with disabilities;1.4 Increased number of diverse groups of visitors;1.5 Promoted cultural heritage and expanded tourist offer in Pelagonija region;2.1 Accessible cultural monument of great importance for tourism development of the targeted cross-border region;2.2 Protected cultural heritage trough joint actions and exchange of knowledge and skills among institutions and experts - conservators across border;2.3 Encouraged young students of fine arts from both countries to practice heritage and become future conservators;2.4 Promoted mutual cooperation, understanding and respect of cultural heritage in the cross-border region;3.1 Upgraded potentials of public infrastructure for cultural and touristic purposes;3.2 Increased capacities of local service providers and artists from the targeted cross-border region to provide high quality tourist services and products;3.3 Increased awareness among communities on the importance and values of regional cultural and natural heritage as a driving force for tourism development.</narrative>
  </description>
